{
  // A no-op Worker whose only purpose is to host excel-number-format's source as the module graph the workers test suite (test/workers/**) imports against under the real workerd runtime -- there is no fetch handler to exercise, only the tokenizer and classifier running inside a Cloudflare Workers isolate to prove the package carries zero Node-only API usage.
